# =============================================================================
# .env.example — Playstore Wizard configuration template
# =============================================================================
#
# HOW TO USE THIS FILE
#
#   Local dev:    Copy to .env.local. Fill in dev values only.
#                 .env.local is git-ignored.
#
#   Production:   NEVER commit real values.
#                 - PUBLIC vars  → wrangler.toml [vars]  OR  Pages dashboard
#                                  → Environment variables
#                 - SECRETS      → `wrangler pages secret put NAME
#                                    --project-name playstorewizard-pro`
#
# NAMING CONVENTION
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_*   = inlined into the browser bundle. Public, visible in
#                     DevTools to anyone who loads your site. Safe to commit
#                     in wrangler.toml.
#
#   No prefix       = server-only. Treat as SECRET unless explicitly listed
#                     below as a p